## 3. Constructive Questions to Ask HR

When discussing termination, resignation, or a exit agreement, ask these targeted questions:

1. **Reasoning & Formal Classification:**
* *"Is this exit initiated formally under Redundancy (Arbetsbrist), or are you proposing a voluntary mutual separation agreement (Sidoavtal/Avgångsavtal)?"*
* *"What will be written on the official Certificate of Employment (Arbetsgivarintyg) regarding the reason for termination?"* *(Crucial for A-kassa approval).*


2. **Notice Period & Garden Leave:**
* *"What is the formal notice period being applied, and am I expected to work through it, or will I be exempted from work duties (Arbetsbefriad) with full pay?"*
* *"If I find a new position during the garden leave period, can I start immediately while still keeping my severance/notice payout (so-called 'Avräkningsfrihet')?"*


3. **Compensation & Benefits:**
* *"How will unused earned vacation days (Semesterersättning) and accrued compensation time be paid out?"*
* *"Will health allowance (Friskvårdsbidrag), company pension (Tjänstepension), and insurance coverage remain active until the official last day of employment?"*


4. **Union & Transition Support:**
* *"Has Unionen / Sveriges Ingenjörer / the local union board been informed or consulted under MBL (Co-determination in Working Life Act)?"*
* *"Am I eligible for TRR / Trygghetsfonden career transition support and severance top-ups?"*



